{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Booking Logic API",
    "description": "Business logic service for managing bookings and reservations",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "paths": {
    "/api/v1/bookings": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "getBookings",
        "tags": [
          "bookings"
        ],
        "summary": "Retrieve bookings with optional user filter",
        "description": "Retrieves confirmed bookings from the booking-data service with optional user filtering. Results are serialized to expose only client-relevant fields.\n\n**Behavior:**\n- When `userId` is provided: Returns only bookings for that specific user\n- When no `userId` is provided: Returns all bookings in the system (typically admin use)\n\n**Data Transformation:**\nBookings are serialized before being returned, transforming MongoDB fields to cleaner client-facing format:\n- `_id` → `id`\n- `course` → `courseId`\n- `user` → `userId`\n- Internal fields like `__v`, `updatedAt`, and `reservation` are excluded\n\n**Use cases:**\n- Display user's booking history\n- Administrative overview of all bookings\n- Booking confirmation pages",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "userId",
            "required": false,
            "description": "ID of the user to filter bookings",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "example": "648a1f4e2f8fb814c8d6f9b1"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "The request was successful",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "data": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "bookings": {
                          "type": "array",
                          "items": {
                            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Booking"
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                "examples": {
                  "getBookingsResponse": {
                    "summary": "Example bookings retrieval",
                    "value": {
                      "data": {
                        "bookings": [
                          {
                            "id": "69642e1f21d2db02c99b9aec",
                            "courseId": "695ba111b2e63b75bee66279",
                            "userId": "648a1f4e2f8fb814c8d6f9b1",
                            "slots": [
                              "695ba111b2e63b75bee6627b"
                            ],
                            "status": "confirmed",
                            "transactionId": "6KT41896LL345210G",
                            "price": "49.00",
                            "createdAt": "2026-01-11T23:11:27.530Z"
                          },
                          {
                            "id": "6969609fe8d3650f299ea570",
                            "courseId": "695ba111b2e63b75bee66279",
                            "userId": "648a1f4e2f8fb814c8d6f9b1",
                            "slots": [
                              "695ba111b2e63b75bee6627b",
                              "695ba111b2e63b75bee6627a"
                            ],
                            "status": "confirmed",
                            "transactionId": "6MC33684BA3458225",
                            "price": "89.00",
                            "createdAt": "2026-01-15T21:48:15.941Z"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "emptyBookingsResponse": {
                    "summary": "Example empty bookings response",
                    "value": {
                      "data": {
                        "bookings": []
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalServerError"
          }
        }
      },
      "post": {
        "operationId": "createBooking",
        "tags": [
          "bookings"
        ],
        "summary": "Create a new booking",
        "description": "Converts a held reservation into a confirmed booking after successful payment. Performs comprehensive validation before delegating to the booking-data service for atomic transaction execution.\n\n**Validation Flow:**\n1. Validates all required fields are present (userId, reservationId, transactionId, price)\n2. Retrieves the reservation from booking-data service\n3. Verifies the reservation belongs to the requesting user (403 if mismatch)\n4. Confirms the reservation is in `held` status (409 if not)\n5. Checks the reservation hasn't expired (409 if expired)\n6. Delegates to booking-data service to atomically create booking and complete reservation\n\n**Transaction Safety:**\nThe actual booking creation and reservation completion happen atomically in the booking-data service's transaction, ensuring consistency.\n\n**Response:**\nReturns the newly created booking in serialized format with clean field names and only client-relevant data.\n\n**Error Scenarios:**\n- 400: Missing required fields\n- 403: Reservation doesn't belong to the user\n- 404: Reservation not found\n- 409: Reservation not in held status or has expired\n- 500: Downstream service error",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "userId": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "reservationId": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "transactionId": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "price": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "userId",
                  "reservationId",
                  "transactionId",
                  "price"
                ]
              },
              "examples": {
                "createBookingRequest": {
                  "summary": "Example booking creation request",
                  "value": {
                    "userId": "TEST_USER_12345",
                    "reservationId": "696b690186faaabbfded290e",
                    "transactionId": "52V73452E9342521J",
                    "price": "79.00"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Booking created successfully",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "data": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Booking"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "examples": {
                  "createBookingResponse": {
                    "summary": "Example booking creation response",
                    "value": {
                      "data": {
                        "booking": {
                          "id": "696b695386faaabbfded2912",
                          "courseId": "695ba111b2e63b75bee66284",
                          "userId": "TEST_USER_12345",
                          "slots": [
                            "695ba111b2e63b75bee66286"
                          ],
                          "status": "confirmed",
                          "transactionId": "52V73452E9342521J",
                          "price": "79.00",
                          "createdAt": "2026-01-17T10:49:55.591Z"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
          },
          "409": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Conflict"
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalServerError"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/reservations": {
      "post": {
        "operationId": "createReservation",
        "tags": [
          "reservations"
        ],
        "summary": "Create a new reservation",
        "description": "Creates a new slot reservation with comprehensive validation before delegating to the booking-data service for atomic slot holding.\n\n**Validation Flow:**\n1. Validates request data (userId, courseId, slotIds array)\n2. Retrieves course details from booking-data service\n3. Validates all requested slot IDs exist in the course\n4. Checks each slot has available capacity (returns 409 if any slot unavailable)\n5. Verifies a pricing option exists for the number of slots selected (returns 400 if no match)\n6. Delegates to booking-data service to atomically create reservation and decrement slot availability\n\n**Reservation Expiration:**\nThe reservation is created with a configurable expiration time (default from bookingSettings). After expiration, a cleanup job will cancel the reservation and restore slot availability.\n\n**Response:**\nReturns a simplified response containing:\n- `reservationId`: The unique identifier for the created reservation\n- `priceToPay`: The price based on the matching pricing option\n\n**Atomicity:**\nSlot availability is decremented atomically with reservation creation in the booking-data service's transaction.\n\n**Error Scenarios:**\n- 400: Invalid data or no pricing option for slot count\n- 404: Course not found\n- 409: One or more slots not available\n- 500: Downstream service error",
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "userId": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "courseId": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "slotIds": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "userId",
                  "courseId",
                  "slotIds"
                ]
              },
              "examples": {
                "createReservationRequest": {
                  "summary": "Example reservation creation request",
                  "value": {
                    "userId": "TEST_USER_12345",
                    "courseId": "695ba111b2e63b75bee66284",
                    "slotIds": [
                      "695ba111b2e63b75bee66286"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Reservation created successfully",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "data": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "reservationId": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "priceToPay": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                "examples": {
                  "createReservationResponse": {
                    "summary": "Example reservation creation response",
                    "value": {
                      "data": {
                        "reservationId": "6969808214d2f13caa1e5f16",
                        "priceToPay": "49.00"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
          },
          "409": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Conflict"
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalServerError"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/reservations/{id}": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "getReservationDetailsById",
        "tags": [
          "reservations"
        ],
        "summary": "Get reservation details by ID",
        "description": "Retrieves reservation details with pricing information, enforcing user authorization checks.\n\n**Authorization:**\nThe endpoint requires the `userId` query parameter and validates that the reservation belongs to the requesting user. Returns 403 if there's a mismatch.\n\n**Processing Flow:**\n1. Validates reservation ID is provided\n2. Retrieves reservation from booking-data service\n3. Verifies reservation belongs to requesting user (403 if not)\n4. Fetches associated course details\n5. Calculates price based on number of slots in reservation\n\n**Response:**\nReturns a simplified response with:\n- `reservationId`: The reservation identifier\n- `priceToPay`: Price calculated from course's pricing options based on slot count\n\n**Use cases:**\n- Retrieve pricing before payment processing\n- Verify reservation details during booking flow\n- Check reservation status for payment confirmation\n\n**Error Scenarios:**\n- 400: Missing reservation ID or no pricing option found\n- 403: Reservation doesn't belong to the requesting user\n- 404: Reservation not found\n- 500: Downstream service error",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "path",
            "name": "id",
            "required": true,
            "description": "Reservation ID",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "example": "6969808214d2f13caa1e5f16"
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "userId",
            "required": true,
            "description": "ID of the user requesting the reservation",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "example": "TEST_USER_12345"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Reservation details retrieved successfully",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "data": {
                      "type": "object",
                      "properties": {
                        "reservationId": {
                          "type": "string"
                        },
                        "priceToPay": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                "examples": {
                  "getReservationDetailsResponse": {
                    "summary": "Example reservation details",
                    "value": {
                      "data": {
                        "reservationId": "6969808214d2f13caa1e5f16",
                        "priceToPay": "49.00"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalServerError"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/reservations/active": {
      "get": {
        "operationId": "getActiveCourseReservationForUser",
        "tags": [
          "reservations"
        ],
        "summary": "Get active reservation for a user and course",
        "description": "Retrieves the most recent active reservation for a specific user and course, filtering by status and expiration.\n\n**Query Requirements:**\nBoth `userId` and `courseId` query parameters are required. Returns 400 if either is missing.\n\n**Active Reservation Criteria:**\nA reservation is considered active if:\n1. Status is `held` (not completed, cancelled, or expired)\n2. Expiration timestamp is in the future (not expired)\n\n**Filtering Logic:**\n1. Fetches all reservations for the user and course from booking-data service\n2. Filters client-side for active reservations (held status + not expired)\n3. Returns the most recent active reservation (last in filtered array)\n4. Returns 404 if no active reservations found\n\n**Response:**\nReturns the full reservation object in serialized format with clean field names:\n- MongoDB `_id` → `id`\n- `course` → `courseId`\n- `user` → `userId`\n- Internal fields excluded\n\n**Use cases:**\n- Check if user has pending reservation before creating a new one\n- Resume incomplete booking flow\n- Display active reservation during course selection\n\n**Error Scenarios:**\n- 400: Missing userId or courseId\n- 404: No active reservation found\n- 500: Downstream service error",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "userId",
            "required": true,
            "description": "ID of the user",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "example": "TEST_USER_12345"
          },
          {
            "in": "query",
            "name": "courseId",
            "required": true,
            "description": "ID of the course",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "example": "695ba111b2e63b75bee66284"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Active reservation found",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "data": {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Reservation"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "examples": {
                  "getActiveReservationResponse": {
                    "summary": "Example active reservation retrieval",
                    "value": {
                      "data": {
                        "reservation": {
                          "id": "696b69fd86faaabbfded291e",
                          "courseId": "695ba111b2e63b75bee66284",
                          "userId": "TEST_USER_12345",
                          "slots": [
                            "695ba111b2e63b75bee66286"
                          ],
                          "status": "held",
                          "expiration": "2026-01-17T11:07:45.157Z"
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalServerError"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/reservations/{id}/cancel": {
      "patch": {
        "operationId": "cancelReservation",
        "tags": [
          "reservations"
        ],
        "summary": "Cancel a reservation",
        "description": "Cancels a held reservation with authorization and status validation, delegating to booking-data service for atomic slot restoration.\n\n**Validation Flow:**\n1. Validates reservation ID and userId are provided (400 if missing)\n2. Retrieves reservation from booking-data service\n3. Verifies reservation belongs to requesting user (403 if mismatch)\n4. Confirms reservation is in `held` status (409 if not)\n5. Delegates to booking-data service to atomically cancel reservation and restore slot availability\n\n**Authorization:**\nStrict ownership validation ensures users can only cancel their own reservations. Returns 403 if the reservation's user ID doesn't match the requesting userId.\n\n**Status Validation:**\nOnly reservations in `held` status can be cancelled. Attempting to cancel completed, already-cancelled, or expired reservations returns 409 conflict.\n\n**Atomicity:**\nThe booking-data service handles the actual cancellation in a transaction that:\n- Updates reservation status to `cancelled`\n- Increments available slots by the number that were held\n- Ensures consistency even under concurrent operations\n\n**Success Response:**\nReturns 204 No Content upon successful cancellation.\n\n**Use cases:**\n- User explicitly abandons booking process\n- User selects different slots and needs to cancel previous reservation\n- Timeout handler cancels expired reservations\n\n**Error Scenarios:**\n- 400: Missing reservation ID or userId\n- 403: Reservation belongs to different user\n- 404: Reservation not found\n- 409: Reservation not in held status\n- 500: Downstream service error",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "path",
            "name": "id",
            "required": true,
            "description": "The unique identifier of the reservation to cancel",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "example": "696b69fd86faaabbfded291e"
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "type": "object",
                "properties": {
                  "userId": {
                    "type": "string"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "userId"
                ],
                "examples": {
                  "cancelReservationRequest": {
                    "summary": "Example cancellation request",
                    "value": {
                      "userId": "TEST_USER_12345"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "204": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NoContent"
          },
          "400": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BadRequest"
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
          },
          "403": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Forbidden"
          },
          "409": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/Conflict"
          },
          "500": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/InternalServerError"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
